      85.89,
      455.99,
      516.95,
      481.06
    ],
    "text": "THE ANNUAL FEAST OF THE NATIONAL BASILICA SHRINE OF OUR LADY OF LANKATEWATTA, RAGAMA \u2013 2025",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      262.68,
      492.99,
      339.62,
      504.06
    ],
    "text": "Gampaha District",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      520.99,
      549.68,
      560.06
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby announced for the information of the General Public that the Annual Feast of the National Basilica Shrine of Our Lady of Lanka Tewatta, Ragama (Feast of the Patients) will be held on 31st August, 2025 and the duration of the Annual Feast will be from 24.08.2025 to 07.09.2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      572.99,
      549.65,
      598.06
    ],
    "text": "1. The attention of the General Public is drawn to the Regulations published in the Gazette Noti\ufb01 cation No. 1953/43 dated 12th February 2016 under the Pilgrimage Ordinance 362 in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      614.99,
      547.17,
      626.06
    ],
    "text": "2. These Rules and Regulations that have been promulgated shall be applicable during the period of this ceremony.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      638.99,
      539.12,
      674.06
    ],
